' === NOTES ===
note bottom of UC07
**Add to Cart Rules:**
• Validate stock availability
• Session-based cart storage
• Real-time price calculation
• Max quantity per product: 99
end note

note bottom of UC09
**Payment Process:**
1. Generate Midtrans Snap Token
2. Display payment UI
3. Customer completes payment
4. Webhook notification
5. Update order status
end note

note bottom of UC10
**Booking (Inquiry) for Live Animals:**
• Select farm & animal
• Choose visit schedule
• Upload required documents
• Wait for farmer approval
• Negotiate price if needed
end note

note bottom of UC14
**Review Requirements:**
• Only after order completed
• Rating: 1-5 stars
• With photo (optional)
• Text review (min 10 characters)
• One review per product per order
end note

@enduml
